  "sourceRulesPath": "sources/editorial/lost-object-recovery/directions/source-rules.json",
  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "艮",
      "text": "东北与近路边、岩石旁是变艮的传统提示。起查可先核最后确知的停留点，相关场所若仍能补问，把实际经过与原件记号一并给清。",
      "sourceRule": "艮",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:11.846Z",
      "textSha256": "f8a1b87ae00cbd4835712d1456173d0533f91ab227ddb747997fcd4a1c62525a"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "传统方向为西北，场所见圆器之中、高处。若已具备改查条件，可请原处核真正用过的收纳物，让新的查询落到可见实物。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:11.847Z",
      "textSha256": "68b4a1a5662f3b8f7361791029f1bddc3efd74f929aedc8647f9d90b1f5be537"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "方位参东方，闹市、大途属于震象。若原来的说法已多次变化，可先拿真实行程核停留点，再向对应招领方问是否有同件。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:11.847Z",
      "textSha256": "a506f6674577720e35e99f3f9056ad9b7b2fbddea9a095aa54d72b9380da314c"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "坎",
      "text": "北方是变坎的方位，水边、酒醋之旁可供对照。若原查找渠道可以调整，可转请能查看实际场所的人核收拾与交接记录。",
      "sourceRule": "坎",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:11.847Z",
      "textSha256": "e5978673209f6eb57803f93b07f3b61f959bd85fa7d9ce51d48f9bb193e61679"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "震",
      "text": "传统取象偏东，道路与闹市是场所线索。若进展已较清楚，可将最后携物路线说具体，请相应停留处核招领实物的独有细节。",
      "sourceRule": "震",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:11.847Z",
      "textSha256": "fc859d07fc2005ee4f2a192a56d5c3fb2f88e0bef30f5d68de1e3d6b48cd95e2"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "乾",
      "text": "西北及高处、圆器之中属于变乾的传统取象。若主要查询已安排妥当，可补核实际使用过的盒格与旁边，把细处看明后再收尾。",
      "sourceRule": "乾",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:11.847Z",
      "textSha256": "265365aa061ee5203150e34f4ac0758a277cabe44ebead91943a29dc53adb66f"
    }
  ]
